00:05:41,250 --> 00:05:47,250
Sex. Murder. Blackmail. There's a first time for everything.

2
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:28,500
Mini's First Time is a comedy, crime, drama film directed by Nick Guthe.

3
00:17:03,750 --> 00:17:09,750
Desperate to be free from her drunken, unloving mother Diane, the beautiful, scheming young Mini seduces her
stepfather Martin and soon convinces him to join her in a sadistic scheme to have Diane declared insane.

4
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:51,000
But their conspiracy soon escalates to murder and when John Garson, a young detective
starts investigating, Martin and Mini begin to turn on each other.

5
00:28:26,250 --> 00:28:32,250
Martin Tennan, played by Alec Baldwin.

6
00:34:07,500 --> 00:34:13,500
Minerva 'Mini' Droggs, played by Nikki Reed.

7
00:39:48,750 --> 00:39:54,750
Mike Rudell, played by Jeff Goldblum.

8
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:36,000
Det. Dwight Garson, played by Luke Wilson.

9
00:51:11,250 --> 00:51:17,250
Jimmy, played by Joe Egender.

10
00:56:52,500 --> 00:56:58,500
Diane Droggs Tennan, played by Carrie-Anne Moss.

11
01:02:33,750 --> 01:02:39,750
Mini's First Time is a 2006 satiric neo-noir black comedy film written and
directed by Nick Guthe and produced by Trigger Street Productions.

12
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
It was screened at the Tribeca Film Festival on May 1, 2006,
and had a limited release on July 14, 2006.

13
01:13:56,250 --> 01:14:02,250
It was released on DVD on October 24, 2006 by HBO Films.

14
01:19:37,500 --> 01:19:43,500
The film explores themes of lolita, blackmail, dark
comedy, stepdaughter, escort service.

15
01:25:18,750 --> 01:25:24,750
The tone is lighthearted and dark and emotional.
